### US-12 — Skapa vårdkontakt
### Kör requesten nedan i ordning med gröna play-pilen till vänster.
### IntelliJ sparar sessionscookien automatiskt mellan anropen.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@user = adli.test
@pass = ANGE_DITT_LOSENORD_HAR

### 1. Registrera ett läkarkonto (öppen endpoint, kräver ingen inloggning)
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{user}}",
  "password": "{{pass}}",
  "email": "adli.test@ward.se",
  "firstName": "Adli",
  "lastName": "Testlakare",
  "personalNumber": "199001011234",
  "roleTitle": "doctor",
  "departmentId": 1
}

> {%
    client.test("201 Created", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 201, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 2. Logga in (form-data, inte JSON)
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username={{user}}&password={{pass}}

### 3. Vem är jag? Ska svara med användarnamnet.
GET {{host}}/auth/me

> {%
    client.test("Inloggad", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Inte inloggad, fick " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 4. HUVUDTESTET — skapa vårdkontakt. Ska ge 201.
POST {{host}}/v%C3%A5rdkontakter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "responsibleStaffId": 1,
  "reason": "Brostsmarta"
}

> {%
    client.test("201 Created", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 201, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
    client.test("Fick ett id tillbaka", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.id !== undefined, "Inget id i svaret");
    });
    client.test("Status ar admitted", function() {
        client.assert(response.body.status === "admitted", "Status: " + response.body.status);
    });
    client.global.set("careContactId", response.body.id);
%}

### 5. Hamta den nyss skapade vardkontakten. Ska ge 200.
GET {{host}}/v%C3%A5rdkontakter/{{careContactId}}

### 6. FELFALL — patient som inte finns. Ska ge 404.
POST {{host}}/v%C3%A5rdkontakter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 99999,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "responsibleStaffId": 1,
  "reason": "Finns inte"
}

> {%
    client.test("404 Not Found", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 404, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
%}

### 7. FELFALL — patientId saknas helt. Ska ge 400 fran @Valid.
POST {{host}}/v%C3%A5rdkontakter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departmentId": 1,
  "responsibleStaffId": 1,
  "reason": "Saknar patientId"
}

> {%
    client.test("400 Bad Request", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 400, "Fick " + response.status);
    });
%}
